   Li, ZX (Corresponding Author), Infrastruct Univ Kuala Lumpur, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.
   Li, Zhenxiang; Jin, Yuanrong, Sichuan Vocat Coll Informat Technol, Guangyuan, Peoples R China.
   Li, Zhenxiang; Jin, Yuanrong, Infrastruct Univ Kuala Lumpur, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.
   Ahmad, Mohammad Nazir, Univ Kebangsaan Malaysia, Inst Visual Informat, Bangi, Malaysia.},
ISSN = {2158-107X},
