   Yue, Dongdong; Li, Ruixuan, Huazhong Univ Sci \& Technol, Sch Comp Sci \& Technol, Wuhan, Peoples R China.
   Zhang, Yan, Western Sydney Univ, Sch Comp Engn \& Math, Sydney, NSW, Australia.
   Tian, Wenlong, Univ South China, Sch Comp Sci \& Technol, Hengyang, Peoples R China.
   Huang, Yongfeng, Tsinghua Univ, Dept Elect Engn, Beijing 100084, Peoples R China.},
DOI = {10.1016/j.jpdc.2020.06.007},
ISSN = {0743-7315},
