   Sect; CyberNB; Ignite Fredericton; ARMIS},
Abstract = {In this paper, we propose an anonymous English auction scheme that
   utilizes trusted hardware and blockchain for the enhancement of the
   privacy of the bidders and the correctness of the auction. We use group
   signature to provide anonymity to the bidders. The hardware-based
   trusted execution environment (TEE) is utilized to ensure that the group
   manager de-anonymizes a group member only once for identifying the
   winner. To incorporate this idea, the blockchain transactions are signed
   using a group signature scheme instead of an ordinary signature scheme.},
