Abstract = {In recent years, the food delivery sector has experienced an influx of
   disruptive models triggered by advances in sensing, robotics and data
   science. Inexpensive IoT technologies when combined with a secure and
   tamperproof data management infrastructure offer a potential solution to
   issues such as safety of perishable products in transit and monitoring
