Number = {10},
Month = {MAY 15},
Abstract = {When creating software, it is important to focus not only on the
   functionality requested by users but also on ensuring that the software
   exhibits qualities such as maintainability, testability,
   comprehensibility, and reusability. To achieve this, developers should
   consider these qualities from the early stages of development and
   implementation. In this paper, we propose a novel methodology for the
   calculation of software metrics to evaluate the aforementioned quality
   characteristics, as well as their verification on the blockchain. The
   primary objective is to provide a simple and transparent approach-using
   smart contracts-for monitoring software metrics throughout the
   development process. This approach enhances software reliability and
   facilitates ongoing maintenance.},
