   Genus},
Abstract = {In this paper, we examine the challenges of groundwater data flow
   management due to institutional harriers and constraints through
   technology. We load the groundwater statistics from end-systems towards
   Distributed Data Storage (DDS) and the blockchain (BC), implementing a
