Abstract = {This study highlights several challenges along with the potential and
   need for blockchain technology implementation in the Malaysian
   healthcare industry context. The systematic review unearths potential
   technological, organizational, environmental, individual-level
   acceptance concerns and challenges associated with deploying blockchain
   to support electronic health records. As such, this research serves as
   the starting point for a chain of studies aiming at detecting,
   analyzing, and responding to such demands. The study is expected to
   guide policy and decision-making procedure of a secure and resilient
   health information exchange for healthcare stakeholders of developing
   nations such as Malaysia.},
