Abstract = {With(1) the continuous improvement of the complexity and integration of
   integrated circuits, verification work is consuming more and more time.
   The generation of test vector and the automation and reusability of
   verification platform are the key factors to improve verification
   efficiency. In this paper, we propose a modeling tool named FALMT. FALMT
   can not only model the function point of the design based on FAL, but
   also can complete the function of automatically generating the high
   reusability verification platform. In this way, the generation of the
   test vector and the verification platform does not require too much
   human intervention. Experiments show that the proposed methodology can
   shorten the verification cycle and speed up the verification process,
   shortening the time by 46.6\%.},
